"citation_ids":["cite.long.record-257bm-c6"],"evidence_ids":["mapping.long.record-257bm-c6"],"id":"long.record-257bm-c6","kind":"claim","label":"Long record Theorem 6.72 (The quotient condition on greedy prefixes)","locator":"Long record Theorem 6.72, p. 65, label record:257bm-c6","source_id":"paper.long.pdf","statement":"*Let $D_c=G\\cap\\{2,\\ldots,c-1\\}$. The condition on the actual greedy prefixes is\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}\n c\\ge4,\\quad c\\notin G\\\\\n \\Longrightarrow\\qquad Q(D_c\\cup\\{c\\},2c-2)\\ge2^{2c-3}.\n \\end{gathered}\n$$\nIt asks for the quotient bound at every skipped rank of the specified half-greedy orbit. This restricts the crossing test of Theorem 6.70 to its actual greedy prefixes. The finite uniqueness results justify that restriction where the cited induction uses it; they do not prove the displayed inequality.*","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.record-257bm-c6","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.record-257bm-c6","id":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/edges/%5B%22long.record-257bm-c6%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.skippedCoreCriticalQuotientSupply_iff_halfGreedySkipped%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/edges/%5B%22long.record-257bm-c6%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.skippedCoreCriticalQuotientSupply_iff_halfGreedySkipped%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/lean.Erdos249257.skippedCoreCriticalQuotientSupply_iff_halfGreedySkipped"},{"derived":true,"family":"provenance","from":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.record-257bm-c6","id":"field:10ae10291c8663d156a0b00cdf44